["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/SupportType/deployed", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "In addition to being supported by the supplier, the software is known to have been deployed and is in use. For a software as a service provider, this implies the software is now available as a service.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
